# qmldir — explicit module manifest for quickshell/modules/notifications/
# (Phase 19 Plan 01 tracer). Mirrors modules/qmldir's own standing
# instruction verbatim: any .qml type added to this directory that is NOT
# declared below becomes unresolvable to importers of `qs.modules.notifications`.
# Any FUTURE type added to this directory MUST do the same, in the same
# commit that creates it.
#
# NotifServer carries the `singleton` keyword; NotifData does not — it is a
# per-notification wrapper, instantiated once per D-Bus arrival via
# NotifServer.qml's own `Component { NotifData {} }` factory, never a
# shared instance. NotifServer.qml carries a matching `pragma Singleton`
# line for the same both-required reason Colours.qml/Motion.qml/Design.qml
# each already state (12-06, binary-verified): with only one of the two,
# bare `NotifServer.propertyName`-style access resolves to `undefined`
# forever, with no load error.
module qs.modules.notifications
singleton NotifServer 1.0 NotifServer.qml
NotifData 1.0 NotifData.qml

# NotifPopupStack/NotifCard (Task 3, this same plan) — the top-right popup
# surface and its card body. Neither a singleton: NotifPopupStack is one
# ordinary instance mounted at shell.qml root, and NotifCard is one
# instance per ListView delegate.
NotifPopupStack 1.0 NotifPopupStack.qml
NotifCard 1.0 NotifCard.qml
